    "summary": "Portrait of a young woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio.A young woman kneels on a yellow and white carpet and plays two drums. She is dressed in a pink blouse, green jacket with jewelled decoration and a bright orange skirt. A pink veil trails down her back from a red and white striped cap with a feather. Behind her is a gold bolster and to the right are three fruits. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
